# S07 — the WIDE typed-resource peer legs (TP direction; rides the 937
# typed bridge recipe): BufViewI64 element-count view, RecMix wide-field
# closure (layout admission + the C caller's runtime offsetof probe), and
# the ORIGINAL wide synchronous callback crossing both boundaries. Each
# leg's first query produces the wide bridge artifacts (facts+plan+callee,
# plus the C object on the cross legs); the second query is a pure hit.
